  "title": "Daffy Is Now a Top 10 DAF — and We Couldn't Be More Excited",
  "summary": "Daffy just released its 2025 Year in Review, and the numbers are remarkable. The modern DAF platform — built around the idea that setting money aside for charity in advance makes people more generous — has officially broken into the top 10 largest DAF providers in the United States¹. As a Chariot partner, we've had a front-row seat to Daffy's growth. And as a team that uses Daffy for Work ourselves, we're not just impressed — we're invested.",
